{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the sunsets, greet the dawns to the sound of ocean waves and... don't miss anything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk along the shore, collect garbage and find real treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851960/extras/c302dd8891a1848a3bc37ceb779a059d.poster.avif?t=1756357871\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851960/extras/c302dd8891a1848a3bc37ceb779a059d.webm?t=1756357871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851960/extras/c302dd8891a1848a3bc37ceb779a059d.mp4?t=1756357871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mountains of strange garbage will tell the story of this island, and cleaning the beach will help unlock new locations. With each step, you get closer to a clean coast... and to the main secret of this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851960/extras/fbe56b61ce8c2f93782350fbdee38e31.poster.avif?t=1756357871\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851960/extras/fbe56b61ce8c2f93782350fbdee38e31.webm?t=1756357871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851960/extras/fbe56b61ce8c2f93782350fbdee38e31.mp4?t=1756357871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a metal detector to find garbage in the sand, dig up the sand with a shovel and take the found items for recycling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recycling garbage 